{"date": "2026-10-29", "word": "Flat", "summary": "A flat day (forecast flat). Thermals stayed flat all day. The upslope ran from about 08:15 to about 16:30. A low day for October: the base stayed down near 3,100 ft (normal 4,500\u20135,400 ft). The evening before, the page called it normal, about 3,700 ft, a miss. Midday the base averaged about 3,100 ft by the Kekoa camera, 600 ft lower than the evening's number; the morning update said about 3,600 ft, off by 500 ft. Most of the day the shear line was crossing Kula Highway between Pukalani and Omaopio; furthest south about 16:52, crossing Kula Highway between Omaopio and the middle Lower Kula Road junction. Data gaps: no readings all day from 3 stations (Kahikinui, Nakula, Upper Kahikinui); the Mesonet could not be reached on 17 of 61 updates.", "therm": "<strong>Flat</strong> for the day, 10:00\u201314:00<div class=\"sub\">Kula Ag's measured air through the NAM sounding (thermal.py); forecast was Flat</div>", "base": "", "notes": ["Saturated, dew-fed morning: low cloud until about 08:30.", "Watched for: Late start (P2) from 09:37; Base will lift (P3) from 08:07."], "chart": "<div class=\"watch\"><div class=\"kind\">What the day did</div><ul><li>Saturated, dew-fed morning: low cloud until about 08:30.</li><li>Watched for: Late start (P2) from 09:37; Base will lift (P3) from 08:07.</li></ul></div><div style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:.9rem;margin:10px 0 2px\">Cloudbase, derived</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted,#6b6b66);margin:2px 0 4px\">\n\n<span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:16px;height:2px;background:#2a78d6;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Derived (stations)</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#3f9d5a;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Kekoa camera</span><span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #898781;box-sizing:border-box;vertical-align:middle\"></span> Camera, no call</span></div>\n<div style=\"position:relative;width:100%;min-width:0;height:220px\"><canvas id=\"basechart\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Derived cloudbase through the day\"></canvas></div>\n<div class=\"sub\">Derived from the stations every 15 minutes during the upslope.</div>\n<script>\n(function () {\n  var d = {\"derived\": [[540, 3280.0], [555, 3350.0], [570, 3370.0], [585, 3250.0], [600, 3300.0], [615, 3360.0], [630, 3690.0], [645, 3490.0], [660, 3350.0], [675, 3240.0], [690, 3030.0], [705, 3000.0], [720, 3130.0], [735, 3140.0], [750, 2980.0], [765, 2980.0], [780, 3370.0], [795, 3380.0], [810, 3200.0], [825, 3270.0], [840, 3330.0], [855, 3190.0], [870, 3120.0], [885, 3070.0], [900, 3230.0], [915, 3180.0], [930, 3000.0], [945, 3000.0], [960, 3070.0]], \"forecast\": [], \"camera\": [[573, 5080.0], [581, 3030.0], [615, 3640.0], [607, 3360.0], [624, 4860.0], [649, 2880.0], [641, 3000.0], [658, 2560.0], [769, 2740.0], [760, 3000.0], [795, 3370.0], [787, 3750.0], [804, 2920.0], [838, 2820.0], [846, 2770.0], [880, 2710.0]], \"hidden\": [], \"nocall\": [590, 598, 632, 666, 675, 684, 692, 701, 709, 718, 726, 735, 743, 752, 778, 813, 821, 829, 855, 864, 872, 889, 898, 906, 915, 923, 932, 941, 949, 957], \"up\": [540, 960], \"nocu\": null}, pt = function (a) { return {x: a[0], y: a[1]}; };\n  var dark = matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches, muted = '#898781', grid = dark ? '#2c2c2a' : '#e1e0d9';\n  var nocu = { id: 'nocu', beforeDatasetsDraw: function (c) { if (!d.nocu) return; var x = c.scales.x, a = c.chartArea, g = c.ctx,\n    x0 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[0]), x1 = x.getPixelForValue(d.nocu[1]);\n    g.save(); g.fillStyle = 'rgba(137,135,129,0.10)'; g.fillRect(x0, a.top, x1 - x0, a.bottom - a.top);\n    g.fillStyle = muted; g.font = '11px sans-serif'; g.textAlign = 'center';\n    g.fillText('No cumulus', (x0 + x1) / 2, a.top + (a.bottom - a.top) / 2); g.restore(); } };\n  var band = { id: 'band', beforeDatasetsDraw: 